<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Meta AP partner lead tracker</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/PapaParse/5.4.1/papaparse.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F2F4F7; --surface:#FFFFFF; --ink:#18202E; --muted:#5F6878; --line:#D9DEE6; --soft:#E8ECF2;
  --accent:#2B3A8C; --pos:#17805A; --neg:#C2412D; --neu:#97A0AF;
  --pos-rgb:23,128,90; --neg-rgb:194,65,45;
  color-scheme: light;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
  :root{
    --bg:#12161D; --surface:#1A1F28; --ink:#E6E9EF; --muted:#9AA3B2; --line:#2C3340; --soft:#232935;
    --accent:#9AA8F5; --pos:#4CC08F; --neg:#EE7A62; --neu:#6B7484;
    --pos-rgb:76,192,143; --neg-rgb:238,122,98;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
h1{font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1.2;margin:0;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 .35rem;font-weight:700}
h3{font-size:1rem;margin:0;font-weight:600}
p{margin:0}
button,select,input{font:inherit;color:inherit}
button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,tr:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}

.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:1.5rem clamp(1rem,3vw,2.5rem) 1rem;max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}
.src{color:var(--muted);font-size:.875rem;margin-top:.3rem}
.src b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.src .warn{color:var(--neg)}
.btn{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:.45rem .85rem;cursor:pointer}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
#loadbar{height:3px;background:var(--accent);width:0;transition:width .4s}

.filters{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.filters .inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:.7rem clamp(1rem,3vw,2.5rem);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 1rem;align-items:flex-end}
.filters label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);gap:.15rem}
.filters select,.filters input{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:.3rem .45rem;font-size:.85rem;max-width:230px}

main{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem clamp(1rem,3vw,2.5rem) 4rem}
section{margin-top:2.25rem}
.lede{color:var(--muted);max-width:74ch;margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:.92rem}
.sechead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:.35rem}

/* funnel */
.funnel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.stage{padding:1rem 1.1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line);position:relative}
.stage:last-child{border-right:0}
.stage .lab{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}
.stage .num{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;margin:.15rem 0}
.stage .conv{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
.stage .conv b{color:var(--ink)}
.stage.key{background:linear-gradient(0deg,var(--soft),var(--soft))}
.stage.key .num{color:var(--accent)}
.notes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem 1.4rem;margin-top:.6rem;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}
.notes .alert{color:var(--neg);font-weight:600}

/* segmented */
.seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
.seg button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:.4rem .8rem;cursor:pointer;font-size:.85rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.seg button:last-child{border-right:0}
.seg button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--accent);color:var(--surface);font-weight:600}

/* tables */
.tblwrap{overflow-x:auto;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.86rem}
th,td{padding:.55rem .75rem;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
th{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;background:var(--surface);position:sticky;top:0}
td:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left;white-space:normal;min-width:230px}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
tbody tr.click{cursor:pointer}
tbody tr.click:hover{background:var(--soft)}
.strength{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem}
.strength .bar{width:70px;height:6px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.strength .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}
.verdict{font-size:.78rem;padding:.1rem .45rem;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.verdict.clear{border-color:var(--pos);color:var(--pos)}
.verdict.maybe{border-color:var(--neu);color:var(--muted)}
.verdict.none{color:var(--muted)}
.dim{color:var(--muted)}
.up{color:var(--pos)} .down{color:var(--neg)}

/* impact plots */
.impact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(520px,1fr));gap:1rem}
@media (max-width:620px){.impact{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:1rem 1.1rem}
.card .meta{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.15rem 0 .8rem}
.arow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,1.3fr) 2fr 3.2rem 3.6rem;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;padding:.28rem 0;font-size:.84rem}
.arow.head{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);padding-bottom:0}
.arow .al{line-height:1.25}
.arow .num{text-align:right}
.arow.thin{opacity:.42}
.track{position:relative;height:18px}
.track .rail{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:8px;height:2px;background:var(--soft)}
.track .base{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;border-left:1.5px dashed var(--muted)}
.track .ci{position:absolute;top:8px;height:2px}
.track .dot{position:absolute;top:9px;border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}
.axis{position:relative;height:14px;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)}
.axis span{position:absolute;transform:translateX(-50%)}
.axis span:first-child{transform:none}
.axis span:last-child{transform:translateX(-100%)}
.legend{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.8rem}
.legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:.35rem;vertical-align:-1px}

/* heatmap */
.pair{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:.8rem;font-size:.9rem}
.pair select{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:.35rem .5rem;max-width:320px}
.heat td,.heat th{text-align:center;white-space:normal;min-width:84px}
.heat td:first-child,.heat th:first-child{text-align:left;min-width:150px}
.heat td.cell{font-weight:600}
.heat td small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}
.heat td.thin{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}

.coh td,.coh th{text-align:center;min-width:64px}
.coh td:first-child,.coh th:first-child{text-align:left;min-width:120px}
.coh td.base{color:var(--muted);text-align:right}
.coh td.v{font-weight:600}
.coh td.v small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem}
.coh td.prog{font-style:italic}
.coh tr.avg td{border-top:2px solid var(--line);font-weight:600;background:var(--soft)}
.empty{padding:1.2rem;color:var(--muted);background:var(--surface);border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px}
details{margin-top:2.5rem;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:.9rem 1.1rem}
summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
details ul{margin:.6rem 0 0;padding-left:1.1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;max-width:80ch}
details li{margin:.3rem 0}
@media (max-width:820px){.funnel{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.stage{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#loadbar{transition:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="loadbar"></div>
<header class="top">
  <div>
    <h1>Meta AP partner lead tracker</h1>
    <p class="src" id="srcLine">Loading data…</p>
  </div>
  <button class="btn" id="reload" type="button">Refresh data</button>
</header>

<div class="filters"><div class="inner">
  <label>From<input type="date" id="fFrom"></label>
  <label>To<input type="date" id="fTo"></label>
  <label>Channel<select id="fFlag"></select></label>
  <label>Form version<select id="fForm"></select></label>
  <label>Ad set<select id="fAdset"></select></label>
  <label>Ad ID<select id="fAd"></select></label>
  <label>Lead age<select id="fAge">
    <option value="0">Any age</option><option value="3">3+ days old</option><option value="7">7+ days old</option><option value="14">14+ days old</option><option value="30">30+ days old</option>
  </select></label>
  <label>Rates over<select id="fDen"><option value="assigned">Assigned leads</option><option value="all">All leads</option></select></label>
  <label>Grey out answers under<select id="fMinN"><option value="5">5 leads</option><option value="10" selected>10 leads</option><option value="20">20 leads</option><option value="30">30 leads</option></select></label>
  <button class="btn" id="reset" type="button">Reset filters</button>
</div></div>

<main>
  <section id="funnelSec" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
    <div class="funnel" id="funnel"></div>
    <div class="notes" id="funnelNotes"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sechead">
      <h2>Which questions separate outcomes</h2>
      <div class="seg" id="outSeg" role="group" aria-label="Outcome">
        <button type="button" data-o="onb" aria-pressed="true">Onboarded</button>
        <button type="button" data-o="fls" aria-pressed="false">First lead shared</button>
        <button type="button" data-o="flsOnb" aria-pressed="false">First lead shared, of onboarded</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lede" id="rankLede"></p>
    <div id="rank"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Answer by answer</h2>
    <p class="lede">Each dot is one answer: its position is the outcome rate, the line is the 95% range, the dashed line is the rate across everyone who answered that question. Green answers sit clearly above it, red clearly below. Bigger dots mean more leads.</p>
    <div class="legend"><span><i style="background:var(--pos)"></i>Clearly above average</span><span><i style="background:var(--neg)"></i>Clearly below average</span><span><i style="background:var(--neu)"></i>Not distinguishable yet</span></div>
    <div class="impact" id="impact"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Answer combinations</h2>
    <p class="lede">Outcome rate for each pair of answers. Only leads who answered both questions are counted, so questions from different form versions may not overlap.</p>
    <div class="pair"><select id="hQ1" aria-label="Rows question"></select><span>against</span><select id="hQ2" aria-label="Columns question"></select></div>
    <div id="heat"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sechead">
      <h2>Weekly signup cohorts</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div class="seg" id="cohOut" role="group" aria-label="Cohort outcome">
          <button type="button" data-v="onb" aria-pressed="true">Onboarded</button>
          <button type="button" data-v="fls" aria-pressed="false">First lead shared</button>
        </div>
        <div class="seg" id="cohView" role="group" aria-label="Cohort values">
          <button type="button" data-v="pct" aria-pressed="true">%</button>
          <button type="button" data-v="n" aria-pressed="false">Count</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">Each row is the leads who filled the form in that week (Monday to Sunday). Week 0 is the share that converted in that same week; each later column is cumulative to the end of that week. Read down a column to compare weeks at the same age. Italic cells are weeks still in progress.</p>
    <div id="cohort"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>By form version</h2>
    <div id="formTbl"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>By ad</h2>
    <div id="adTbl"></div>
  </section>

  <details>
    <summary>How this is calculated</summary>
    <ul>
      <li>Only leads from campaign #165 (the AP partner campaign) are included; other campaigns in the sheet are ignored. Change <code>CAMPAIGN_PREFIX</code> in the script to point at a different campaign.</li>
      <li>One row per Meta form lead. Duplicate lead IDs are dropped; repeat phone numbers keep only the earliest submission.</li>
      <li>Assigned = <code>is_assigned</code> is "Assigned". Onboarded = <code>is_onboared</code> is "Onboarded". First lead shared = <code>first_lead_date</code> filled. First active = <code>first_active_date</code> filled.</li>
      <li>Channel comes from <code>partner_team_flag</code> after assignment (AP, TP, or Unflagged when not yet assigned), not from the form name.</li>
      <li>"Rates over" switches the denominator. Assigned leads is the default because an unassigned lead cannot be onboarded, which would otherwise make every answer look worse in proportion to how often it goes unassigned.</li>
      <li>Answers are read question by question from <code>businessType</code>, so different form versions can be mixed. Pincode is turned into two derived questions: whether it looks like a valid 6-digit Indian pincode, and the postal region from its first digit.</li>
      <li>Rates show a 95% Wilson interval. An answer is coloured only when its interval sits wholly above or below the question average.</li>
      <li>Question strength is Cramér's V from a chi-square test of answer against outcome (0 = no relationship, 0.3+ = strong). "Clear signal" means p &lt; 0.05; "Possible" means p &lt; 0.2. With very few outcomes (under 5) the test is not run.</li>
      <li>Lead age filter keeps leads at least that many days old, so recent leads that have not had time to convert do not drag rates down.</li>
    </ul>
  </details>
</main>

