const FILTERS = [['fFlag','flag','All channels'],['fForm','form','All form versions'],['fAdset','adset','All ad sets'],['fAd','ad','All ads']];
function buildFilters(rows){
  for (const [id, key, all] of FILTERS){
    const sel = $(id), cur = sel.value;
    const counts = {}; rows.forEach(r => counts[r[key]] = (counts[r[key]]||0) + 1);
    const vals = Object.keys(counts).sort((a,b) => counts[b]-counts[a]);
    sel.innerHTML = `<option value="">${all}</option>` + vals.map(v => `<option value="${esc(v)}">${esc(v)} (${counts[v]})</option>`).join('');
    if (vals.includes(cur)) sel.value = cur;
  }
  const dates = rows.map(r => r.created).sort();
  if (dates.length){
    $('fFrom').min = $('fTo').min = dates[0]; $('fFrom').max = $('fTo').max = dates[dates.length-1];
    if (!$('fFrom').value) $('fFrom').value = dates[0];
    if (!$('fTo').value) $('fTo').value = dates[dates.length-1];
  }
}
function filtered(){
  const f = {from:$('fFrom').value, to:$('fTo').value, age:+$('fAge').value, today:todayIST()};
  const sel = {}; FILTERS.forEach(([id,key]) => sel[key] = $(id).value);
  return window._allData.filter(r => {
    if (f.from && r.created < f.from) return false;
    if (f.to && r.created > f.to) return false;
    if (f.age && dayDiff(f.today, r.created) < f.age) return false;
    for (const k in sel) if (sel[k] && r[k] !== sel[k]) return false;
    return true;
  });
}
function denomRows(rows){ return $('fDen').value === 'assigned' ? rows.filter(r => r.assigned) : rows; }
